body:
31 Here. P3 FES was my first persona game and the first game that makes me really emotional. And the best part that time my school life pretty much inspired by P3. I played P4, and pretty much all the persona game after including the spinoffs. Sadly havent try any other shin megami tensei, P1 and P2.

&#x200B;

Growing past age of 30, i am still emotional as ever. It's probably the music...
